// The ShowHistory signal and method share a name on purpose (see the D-Bus
// XML), and Vala has one namespace for both: left alone, vapigen keeps the
// signal and drops the method. The method takes the name here instead, beside
// its show_history_sync twin, which keeps the signal where Vala code already
// connects to it.
Client.show_history#method name="show_history_async"
